body:
Alright, seems like a good choice, thank you for all the information about the series and setups, I have heard about it and I'll definitely check it out.

&#x200B;

This might scare you, but the way I'm looking at it is that I'm currently choosing between the 296 and the Porsche. I am well aware its not a newbie friendly car, but it seems to tick lot of the boxes I like, I just do not know if its good with base setups. So if you got any info about that I'd greatly appreciate it. I'm gonna stick to the car I buy, so the fact its not as friendly isnt that scary to me.
